%% alt: Agentic retrieval as a loop. From a question, the agent plans what it needs to know. It chooses a tool: search the index, grep or list files, or open a whole document. It reads the results and decides whether it has enough. If not, it refines the query and plans again; if so, it answers with citations.
flowchart TB
  Q[Question]:::human --> P[Plan: what do I need to know?]:::model
  P --> T{Choose a tool}:::model
  T --> S[Search index]:::tool
  T --> G[grep, list files]:::tool
  T --> O[Open a whole<br/>document]:::tool
  S & G & O --> R[Read results]:::model
  R --> E{Enough to answer?}:::control
  E -.->|no: refine query| P
  E -->|yes| A[Answer with citations]:::human
